License: LGPL-2.1+
 Every source file in this project carries an LGPL-2.1-or-later header. The
 full text of the licence is in the 'LGPL' file.

 The 'GPL' file is retained because the CUPS PPD template
 (src/backend/cups_backend/plicapage.ppd) is derived from the OpenPrinting
 CUPS-Filters generic PDF PPD and is published under the GNU General Public
 License. Upstream's COPYING described the project as "GPL-2 and LGPL-2.1+"
 for this reason.

